WEBVTT

00:00:40.930 --> 00:00:43.020
Yata Misaki-kun of HOMRA.

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:45.980
Whaddya want?

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:50.860
I understand that you’ve been friends with our
Fushimi-kun since before you joined HOMRA.

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:52.990
He’s no friend!

00:00:52.990 --> 00:00:56.110
He betrayed me, and Mikoto-san, by becoming a Blue!

00:00:56.110 --> 00:01:00.990
It may come to be that he will
share my destiny and have to die.

00:01:00.990 --> 00:01:03.330
If that happens, I’m sorry.

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:05.420
I apologize in advance.

00:01:07.210 --> 00:01:08.170
What the hell does that mean?

00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:12.460
Didn’t he betray you and leave the Blues?!

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.590
And now... that double-crosser is with the Greens!

00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:17.640
By my order.

00:01:18.090 --> 00:01:23.310
Before the Christmas mission,
I gave Fushimi-kun my orders.

00:01:23.310 --> 00:01:25.770
If through some unforeseen intervention,

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:27.560
the mission should fail,

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:30.190
and in the event the Slates are stolen,

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:31.730
I ordered him to use whatever means available

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:35.190
to infiltrate JUNGLE’s central command.

00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:39.160
Since he was once a turncoat, he was perfect for the job.

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:40.410
W-What?!

00:01:41.740 --> 00:01:44.330
But isn’t that dangerous?

00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:46.250
If he’s outed, he...

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:48.790
He could be killed by the Greens!

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:50.670
That’s true.

00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:57.470
I sent Fushimi-kun out on a mission
with no guarantees that he would return alive.

00:01:57.470 --> 00:02:00.800
Because he was the only one that could pull it off.

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:04.930
Of course, he accepted the mission fully aware of the risks.

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:07.770
Why would you do that?

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:10.860
How could you even think of giving
your own clansman such a mission?

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:11.690
Why?!

00:02:12.770 --> 00:02:13.820
Why?

00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:18.320
Because we can’t let JUNGLE have their way.

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:21.160
SCEPTER 4 is a clan that stands for order.

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:25.120
We will not stand by and watch the world fall into chaos.

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:28.870
Furthermore, Fushimi-kun is a member of SCEPTER 4.

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:33.840
However, there is one way for him to live through this.

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:38.420
And that is to betray me and really join JUNGLE.

00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:42.640
Do you think he would do that?

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:47.100
You are an old friend and know him well,

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:48.600
don’t you, Yata Misaki-kun?

00:04:32.210 --> 00:04:35.460
Beneath the ground of that light pillar over there

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:39.210
is a water intake station
that was partially built then abandoned.

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:42.220
It seems JUNGLE made it their hideout.

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:48.220
The Slates was taken to this facility’s lowest level.

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:50.470
That’s where we’re going.

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:52.890
And we’ll act as support.

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:56.810
We’ll make sure to get you three down to the lowest level.

00:04:56.810 --> 00:04:59.980
Got that, everyone?
Let’s show them what we’re made of!

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:01.360
Yeah!

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:03.110
Let’s do it!

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:10.280
Here is yours, Misaki.

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:12.500
Right... You can count on me!

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:17.670
I’m in charge of Basement Level 9, right?

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:19.880
Yata-chan, it’s okay.

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:21.630
Kusanagi-san...

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:23.340
What do you mean “okay”?

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:25.340
Go and save Fushimi.

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:27.760
You can take your position after that.

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:31.260
But if I don’t make it in time...

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:33.140
You’ll be fine.

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:35.520
I believe in you, Misaki.

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:44.280
This is it!

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:46.150
Everyone, hang onto something!

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:24.070
Aren’t you gonna assist him, Zenjo?

00:06:24.070 --> 00:06:26.570
That’s not my job.

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:33.080
Is your job to cut down kings like Habari,
who've lost control of their own powers?

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:35.790
You can’t afford to be distracted!

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:51.970
Just what are you clinging to, Munakata?

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:54.640
Aren’t you just being stubborn?

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:56.520
The die has been cast.

00:06:56.520 --> 00:07:00.100
The world you’re so determined
to protect has already been crushed.

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:03.400
Yes, I <i>am</i> being stubborn.

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:08.400
I hate the fact that I lost to you
more than I thought I would.

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:11.240
Do you hate me that much?

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:13.070
I do.

00:07:13.070 --> 00:07:14.620
I hate the way you live.

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:17.950
Well, if we’re talking about likes and dislikes,

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:20.080
I don’t care for you either.

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:23.380
Watching you reminds me of how I used to be.

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:28.130
Didn’t getting your sword broken once teach you?

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:30.550
Flaunt your immature ideals all you like...

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:33.430
You still won’t be able to change a thing!

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:47.190
There are more of them!

00:07:47.190 --> 00:07:48.360
Get ‘em!

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:50.360
Hold it right there!

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:54.200
Just in the nick of time!

00:07:56.780 --> 00:07:59.200
Domyoji! Don’t charge in on your own!

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:06.540
Akiyama! Benzai! Let’s go!

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:08.710
Stay sharp, Benzai!

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:10.550
Right, you too!

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:14.220
I’m going in first!

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:32.990
Are you okay, Captain?

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:42.870
Just what do you think you’re all doing here?

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:44.500
We surmised that at the present time,

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:49.630
our most crucial mission is the swift
suppression of the JUNGLE stronghold,

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:51.380
so we have come to assist you, Captain.

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:54.260
I issued no such orders.

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:56.390
Besides, I’m no longer your captain...

00:08:56.800 --> 00:08:59.100
SCEPTER 4 aren’t aimless followers

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:01.350
who just sit around waiting for orders, sir.

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:05.270
We only use the name “Tokyo Legal Affairs Bureau Civil Registry Department Division 4”

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:08.150
as a cover for SCEPTER 4’s activities.

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:11.150
He’s right. It’s all just a façade.

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:15.950
No matter when or where,
your cause is our cause, Captain.

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:20.160
We are the clansmen
of the Blue King Munakata Reisi!

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:23.330
Currently, every member
of SCEPTER 4 has been mobilized

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:27.250
and assigned to quell riots
and render aid to the citizens.

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:28.630
We, the Special Police Force,

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:30.670
will take control of the JUNGLE stronghold,

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:32.630
and until we suppress the source of the uprising,

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:37.180
we stand ready to give our lives
to prevent the chaos from spreading.

00:09:37.890 --> 00:09:39.680
What are your orders, Captain?

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:47.810
We of SCEPTER 4 carry out our duties as men of the sword.

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:49.940
We do not allow disorder on consecrated land,

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:52.070
we do not allow violence in this world,

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:54.940
we clear the fog that threatens our boundaries!

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:55.900
Men...

00:09:56.070 --> 00:09:57.400
Draw your swords!

00:09:57.400 --> 00:09:58.280
Akiyama, ready!

00:09:58.280 --> 00:09:59.320
Benzai, ready!

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:00.200
Kamo, ready!

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:01.120
Domyoji, ready!

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:02.160
Enomoto, ready!

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:03.080
Fuse, ready!

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:03.990
Goto, ready!

00:10:03.990 --> 00:10:05.370
Hidaka, ready!

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:08.540
Awashima, ready!

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:11.790
So that’s the Blue Clan’s code of honor, eh?

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:14.420
Sounds lovely.

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:18.840
But just so you know, it’s impossible
to make reality that pretty!

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:27.100
You are a man who ran away
from the tragedy that unfolded before you

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:29.810
You see the world through clouded eyes,

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:34.610
and obscure what you should see
with vague, non-committal actions.

00:10:34.610 --> 00:10:38.360
Hisui Nagare died long ago...

00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:40.700
What you are doing is...

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:43.030
aiding a dead man who wants to create paradise!

00:10:43.030 --> 00:10:45.870
As if I didn’t know that!

00:11:09.850 --> 00:11:12.560
We will advance with sword in hand...

00:11:13.190 --> 00:11:16.360
For our cause is pure!

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:24.740
I can’t believe you won...

00:11:24.740 --> 00:11:27.240
Fine then...

00:11:27.240 --> 00:11:30.160
Stick to that stubborn ideal of yours...

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:32.540
See how far it will take you...

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:40.420
Alright!

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:42.300
We did it!

00:11:47.770 --> 00:11:49.220
Captain!

00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:52.270
You must undo your Sanctum immediately!

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:54.020
I already did.

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:57.690
But it seems my will alone
is no longer enough to make it disappear.

00:11:58.730 --> 00:12:00.280
Everyone, stand back!

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:02.660
You too, Zenjo-san.

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:05.570
I am his lieutenant.

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:09.950
If necessary, I will...

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:16.460
This is Akagi. B2 standing by!

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:19.460
This is Bando. B3 standing by!

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:22.470
This is Chitose. B4 standing by!

00:12:22.470 --> 00:12:25.470
This is Dewa. B5 standing by!

00:12:25.470 --> 00:12:28.970
This is Eric. B6 standing by.

00:12:28.970 --> 00:12:31.980
This is Fujishima. B7 standing by.

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:34.850
Thanks to the Blue King keeping a lock on above,

00:12:34.850 --> 00:12:36.860
we may still have a chance.

00:12:36.860 --> 00:12:38.980
The only ones left are Izumo and Misaki.

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:42.860
Shoot him!

00:12:42.860 --> 00:12:43.740
Sorry, but I’m in a hurry.

00:12:43.740 --> 00:12:45.200
Don’t let him get away!

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:45.700
Stop him!

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:47.450
I’m gonna pass through!

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:54.290
Sorry I’m late.

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:57.290
Kusanagi, B8 standing by!

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:00.590
All right, this is as far as I go.

00:13:00.590 --> 00:13:05.430
I can’t accompany you beyond this,
but good luck, Shiro-san.

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:06.300
Right.

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:08.760
Thank you, Kusanagi-san.

00:13:09.260 --> 00:13:11.970
We’re grateful for the Red Clan’s help.

00:13:12.730 --> 00:13:14.560
See you later, guy with sunglasses!

00:13:14.560 --> 00:13:16.310
Make me that pancake of yours again, okay?

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:18.060
Sure thing, Neko-chan.

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:21.280
When this is over,
I’ll make you a tower of pancakes.

00:13:23.610 --> 00:13:24.570
Yay!

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:27.780
Die!

00:13:30.990 --> 00:13:32.330
Lame...

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:36.170
You’re supposed to challenge the final dungeon
after you earn enough experience points.

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:40.540
It’s too bad I’m not letting you return
to your last save point.

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:44.470
Shut up, game brain brat...

00:13:44.470 --> 00:13:49.220
Turning off the power button
won’t save you from anything...

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:51.100
not when it comes to reality.

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:54.180
There are times when you still have to fight...

00:13:54.180 --> 00:13:56.940
Even if you know you can’t win!

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:05.740
Can’t believe I’m the one lecturing kids about reality...

00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:08.110
This reality sucks...

00:14:08.570 --> 00:14:11.410
Considering the hazard pay, this isn’t worth it.

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:18.040
Why the hell did I agree to this job in the first place?

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:21.000
Saruhiko!

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:21.840
Misaki?

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:24.840
Bastard!
Where the hell are you, Saruhiko?!

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:30.590
I don’t believe it...
That idiot really came after me...

00:14:30.590 --> 00:14:32.300
Saruhiko!

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:33.970
Die!

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:37.310
Damn you! Trying to look good all by yourself!

00:14:37.310 --> 00:14:39.560
If you die without telling me anything,

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:41.400
I’ll never forgive you!

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:57.330
Oh, are you switching players?

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:59.080
Fine with me!

00:15:07.630 --> 00:15:08.630
You’re not getting away!

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:11.550
Saruhiko! You still alive?!

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:13.220
Hey, Monkey!

00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:16.640
You’re late...

00:15:18.270 --> 00:15:21.100
And you call yourself the clan’s lead attacker?

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:22.980
What a joke...

00:15:22.980 --> 00:15:24.480
Shut up!

00:15:25.150 --> 00:15:26.820
Why didn’t you tell me?

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:30.740
You know I can’t talk
about top secret missions, stupid.

00:15:30.740 --> 00:15:32.490
Couldn’t you guess?

00:15:33.240 --> 00:15:36.410
How was I supposed to guess just from that?!

00:15:36.410 --> 00:15:39.250
You’ve always been like this...

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:42.120
Yeah, I’m stupid!

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:45.250
That’s why unless you tell me, I won’t get it.

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:48.760
Would you have understood even if I told you?

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:50.970
Then say it in a way I understand!

00:15:50.970 --> 00:15:52.890
Keep saying it until I <i>do</i> understand!

00:15:52.890 --> 00:15:56.430
If you didn’t tell me anything, and you died...

00:15:56.850 --> 00:16:00.770
I would’ve thought you were a traitor forever!

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:04.650
I <i>am</i> a traitor.

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:06.150
No, you’re not!

00:16:07.110 --> 00:16:10.990
You risked your life to go this far for the Blue King...

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:14.780
Just as I would for Mikoto-san and Anna...

00:16:16.160 --> 00:16:20.160
That means to you, the Blue King was your king all along!

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:27.170
Fushimi Saruhiko of SCEPTER 4,
is a stand up guy in my book!

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:36.850
Whoa!

00:16:36.850 --> 00:16:38.850
Saruhiko’s in critical condition...

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:41.480
And your health bar is starting to turn yellow.

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:42.350
What’ll you do?

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:44.020
Hey!

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:46.230
Don’t you have any friends to play games with?

00:16:46.230 --> 00:16:48.690
I’ve always played solo.

00:16:48.690 --> 00:16:52.990
It’s a hundred times better than having to deal
with weak players who slow me down.

00:16:52.990 --> 00:16:55.660
I’m strong enough on my own, anyway.

00:16:55.660 --> 00:16:58.030
The only one who’s fun to play with is Nagare.

00:16:58.030 --> 00:17:01.580
That’s why anyone who gets in
Nagare’s way... will be crushed!

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:11.670
Misaki!

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:18.890
So JUNGLE was your refuge, eh...

00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:21.930
You remind me of how we used to be...

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:24.810
Even so...
It’s time for you to go home, kid...

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:26.350
You’re so full of it!

00:17:26.350 --> 00:17:29.770
I’m still stronger than the two of you put together!

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:31.610
Guess again!

00:17:39.910 --> 00:17:42.080
It’s like old times...

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:44.080
Fighting side by side with you.

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:47.830
It’s not the same... as back then.

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:50.670
Yeah, it’s not the same.

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:54.260
Yata Misaki, Red Clansman, and...

00:17:55.720 --> 00:17:56.510
Say it!

00:17:57.470 --> 00:18:00.510
Fushimi Saruhiko, Blue Clansman...

00:18:00.510 --> 00:18:02.140
...will take you on!
...will take you on!

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:07.100
Think you has-beens are so cool?!

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:12.520
I’m on a job here.

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:15.990
And I can’t waste time playing games with a kid!

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:29.000
Saruhiko!

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:32.290
Get lost, you old bastards!

00:18:41.050 --> 00:18:43.310
Go home.

00:19:00.860 --> 00:19:03.080
“Go home”?

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:06.410
Since when did you start giving lectures to kids?

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:07.660
What, are you all grown-up now?

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:10.370
Shut up.

00:19:10.370 --> 00:19:12.920
I don’t know if I’m grown-up,

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:15.050
but I’m not a kid anymore.

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:17.550
<i>Yata-san! Hey, Yata-san!</i>

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:18.760
<i>Can you hear me?</i>

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:20.300
<i>Where are you?!</i>

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:22.090
Hey, Kamamoto.

00:19:22.090 --> 00:19:24.180
Saruhiko is okay.

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:26.100
Well, sort of...

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:27.470
<i>That’s good news!</i>

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:30.190
<i>Anna, Fushimi is okay!</i>

00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:31.480
<i>But please hurry!</i>

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:34.690
<i>We can’t start unless you</i> <i>get to your floor, Yata-san!</i>

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:37.820
Yeah... Got it.

00:19:38.940 --> 00:19:40.570
Go.

00:19:41.530 --> 00:19:43.700
And count me out of this one.

00:19:44.320 --> 00:19:47.240
Or I’ll be working overtime without pay.

00:19:47.240 --> 00:19:48.700
But you’re...

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:51.580
Who matters to you the most right now?

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:56.460
Anna.

00:19:56.460 --> 00:19:58.800
Then hurry up and get going.

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:01.220
You do your job.

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:03.970
I can get out of here by myself.

00:20:05.800 --> 00:20:07.350
Misaki...

00:20:09.560 --> 00:20:14.100
I’ll think about how to say things
so that even a fool can understand.

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:19.440
Let’s talk some more later!

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:34.710
Found him! Over here!

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:39.590
I’ve used up all my knives...

00:20:40.090 --> 00:20:45.970
He’s simple-minded, stupid,
ignorant, and doesn’t get a thing...

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:50.600
And yet somehow he’s able to
come up with the perfect answer...

00:20:50.600 --> 00:20:54.310
<i>That means to you, the Blue King</i> <i>was your king all along!</i>

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:57.690
No wonder I’d go through all this trouble just for him...

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:03.700
An escape route has been secured.

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:05.820
I don’t recall asking for your service.

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:09.830
I’ve already received my payment from your superior.

00:21:19.040 --> 00:21:20.550
<i>Bright and shiny teeth...</i>

00:21:20.550 --> 00:21:21.960
<i>That can light down the abyss...</i>

00:21:21.960 --> 00:21:23.340
<i>Brings a healthy life...</i>

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:31.350
You do understand, don’t you?

00:21:31.350 --> 00:21:33.430
I won’t let you get past me.

00:21:34.020 --> 00:21:36.310
I will hinder you with everything I’ve got.

00:21:39.770 --> 00:21:41.320
Mishakuji Yukari...

00:21:41.320 --> 00:21:42.860
This battle will be one on one.

00:21:42.860 --> 00:21:43.820
Kuro?!

00:21:44.110 --> 00:21:46.360
You two go ahead.

00:21:46.360 --> 00:21:49.320
I must beat this man alone.

00:21:49.990 --> 00:21:53.700
Let me do it my way... just this once.

00:21:57.670 --> 00:22:01.210
This is the first time you’ve insisted on anything.

00:22:02.670 --> 00:22:04.710
I admire your spirit, but...

00:22:05.300 --> 00:22:06.630
Kuro-chan...

00:22:11.640 --> 00:22:17.060
Unless you defeat me, I’ll waste
no time in going after your king.

00:23:58.950 --> 00:24:01.040
The king who desires change...

00:24:01.040 --> 00:24:03.500
The king who prepares for their final destruction...

00:24:03.500 --> 00:24:06.090
Next time on <i>K: Return of Kings,</i>

00:24:06.090 --> 00:24:08.800
#13 “Kings”.

00:24:08.800 --> 00:24:12.340
The first king will put an end to everything...
